      <data key="d4">The Abs Diet was created by Dave Zinczenko and popularized in his book of the same name. The Abs Diet involves a balanced diet that incorporates 12 different "power foods" and participation in daily exercise. The goal of the Abs Diet is to achieve lifelong weight loss. However, the immediate focus o</data>
