      <data key="d2">Blackbrush | Blackbush | Chaparro Prieto</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Acacia-rigidula</data>
      <data key="d4">Acacia rigidula is a shrub that grows in southwest and west Texas, as well as in the northern states of Mexico . Acacia rigidula is found in certain weight-loss and athletic performance supplements, but it can be unsafe to ingest. A variety of biogenic amines and alkaloids have been isolated from ex</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Insufficient reliable information is available; avoid using.</data>
