    <node id="Activated Charcoal">
      <data key="d0">supplement</data>
      <data key="d1" />
      <data key="d2">Activated Carbon | Animal Charcoal | Carbo Vegetabilis | Carbón Activado | Charbon Actif | Charbon Activé | Charbon Animal | Charbon Médicinal | Charbon Végétal | Charbon Végétal Activé</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Activated-Charcoal</data>
      <data key="d4">Charcoal is made from peat, coal, wood, coconut shell, or petroleum. It has been used medicinally for thousands of years, and for gastrointestinal decontamination for over 100 years . Charcoal is activated by increasing the number of pores, thus increasing the surface area. This is achieved by heati</data>
      <data key="d5">✅ SAFE: Possibly Safe when used orally short-term. Activated charcoal 50 grams three times daily for 8 days has been used with apparent safety in pregnancy .</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
