      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Adrenal-extract</data>
      <data key="d4">Adrenal extracts are derived from raw cow, pig, or sheep adrenal glands gathered from slaughterhouses . Traditionally, adrenal extract has been used to treat Addison disease . Adrenal extracts are derived from raw cow, pig, or sheep adrenal glands gathered from slaughterhouses and possibly from sick</data>
