      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Aegeline</data>
      <data key="d4">Aegeline is an alkaloid found in the leaves and bark of the bael plant . It is also made synthetically . Aegeline was included as an ingredient in certain weight loss products in 2013 . However, it was removed from these products after warning letters were sent by the US Food and Drug Administration</data>
