      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Agaricus-Mushroom</data>
      <data key="d4">Agaricus mushroom originated in the Piedade Mountain area of Brazil, but is now cultivated in Brazil, China, Japan, and the US . It is used medicinally and consumed as a food and tea .</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Insufficient reliable information available; avoid using.</data>
