      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Alchemilla</data>
      <data key="d4">Alchemilla is a perennial herb that is widely distributed throughout most of Europe . It has traditionally been used orally for gastrointestinal disorders and as an anti-inflammatory and diuretic. It has also been used topically as an astringent and bath additive.</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Insufficient reliable information available; avoid using.</data>
