      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Algin</data>
      <data key="d4">Algin is a polysaccharide. It is extracted from brown seaweed, particularly from the genera Ascophyllum, Macrocystis, and Laminaria . Algin is also made by some types of bacteria .</data>
      <data key="d5">ℹ️ No pregnancy data available. Consult your physician.</data>
