      <data key="d4">Alpha hydroxy acids are natural acids found in foods, including, but not limited to, citrus fruits, sugarcane, sour milk, apples, and grapes. Some alpha hydroxy acids are commonly used in cosmetic products. Others are used orally, intravaginally, or by inhalation . Refer to this list of Alpha Hydrox</data>
