      <data key="d4">Alpha-GPC is a compound naturally produced in the body from choline. It is a precursor to the neurotransmitter acetylcholine. Synthetic alpha-GPC is used as a dietary supplement . In some parts of Europe, alpha-GPC is regulated as a prescription drug for brain health .</data>
