      <data key="d4">American adder's tongue is a plant with lily-like flowers. The leaves and tubers are sometimes used in medicine . KEY HIGHLIGHTS - Traditionally used for skin ulcers and as an emetic, but there is no evidence to support its use for any condition. - The safety of American adder's tongue when used ora</data>
