      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/American-Ginseng</data>
      <data key="d4">The term "ginseng" typically refers to extracts prepared from plants of the Panax genus, most commonly Panax ginseng (Asian ginseng) or Panax quinquefolius (American ginseng) . American ginseng grows mainly in North America, with much of it being produced in Ontario, Canada . Wild American ginseng h</data>
