      <data key="d4">Andrographis is a plant native to Asian countries such as India and Sri Lanka that is now cultivated and naturalized in other areas of the world . Known as "king of bitters," it is commonly used in Ayurvedic medicine . Traditionally, andrographis has been used for various conditions due to its purpo</data>
