      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Androstenetrione</data>
      <data key="d4">Androstenetrione is promoted as an alternative to "prohormones" such as androstenedione. Marketers claim that androstenetrione increases the body's natural testosterone levels and therefore is free from the negative side effects of prohormones. There is no reliable evidence to substantiate these cla</data>
      <data key="d5">ℹ️ No pregnancy data available. Consult your physician.</data>
