      <data key="d4">Angel's trumpet is a shrub with trumpet-like flowers, native to South America, and also found in North America, Europe, Africa, Asia, and Australia. It is cultivated for ornamental purposes in Europe and the United States . It may be confused with jimson weed, which grows wild throughout the US . An</data>
