      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Animal-Assisted-Therapy</data>
      <data key="d4">Animal-assisted therapy (AAT) involves using a trained animal to help adults and children recover from or cope with various health conditions. The therapy can vary by the individual, animal type, or type of treatment needed . AAT might involve the intentional incorporation of animals into a treatmen</data>
      <data key="d5">✅ SAFE: Insufficient reliable information available; however, there is no reason to expect significant safety issues when used appropriately.</data>
