      <data key="d4">Annatto is a small tree or shrub native to the Amazon region of South America. It grows in various South American countries, including Peru, Mexico, and Ecuador, and is also cultivated in Indonesia, India, and East Africa . Annatto is cultivated for its seeds, which are used as a natural color in ma</data>
