      <data key="d4">Anodyne therapy is a type of light therapy that is intended to help relieve the symptoms of pain, stiffness, muscle spasms, and circulation irregularities. This form of treatment is usually given in addition to physical therapy. The device to administer Anodyne therapy is marketed and sold by Spectr</data>
