    <node id="Anti-Inflammatory Diet">
      <data key="d0">supplement</data>
      <data key="d1" />
      <data key="d2">Anti-inflammation diet | Dieta antiinflamatoria | Dietary inflammatory index | DII | Low Inflammatory Diet | Régime anti-inflammatoire</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Anti-Inflammatory-Diet</data>
      <data key="d4">An anti-inflammatory diet usually involves eliminating foods that induce inflammation while also consuming foods and supplements with anti-inflammatory properties . There is no one specific anti-inflammatory diet. An evidence-based, validated scale called the dietary inflammatory index (DII) has bee</data>
      <data key="d5">✅ SAFE: There is insufficient reliable information available about the safety of anti-inflammatory diets during pregnancy or lactation, as this has not been specifically evaluated in clinical trials. Observational research has found that consuming an anti-inflammatory dietary pattern is associated with a reduced risk of any obstetric complication, such as gestational diabetes, miscarriage, low birthweight, and breastfeeding failure, when compared with consuming a more pro-inflammatory dietary pattern .</data>
      <data key="d6" />
