      <data key="d4">Aromatherapy involves the therapeutic use of essential oils via inhalation or on the skin to improve physical, emotional, or spiritual well-being . Essential oils are aromatic constituents of certain plant parts such as flowers, fruits, and seeds. The term essential is used because the oil contains</data>
