    <node id="Arsenic">
      <data key="d0">supplement</data>
      <data key="d1" />
      <data key="d2">Arsenate | Arsenic Pentoxide | Arsenic Trichloride | Arsenic Trioxide | Arsénico | Arsenicum Album | Arsenicum Iodatum | Arsenite | Arsénite | Arsénite de Sodium</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Arsenic</data>
      <data key="d4">Arsenic is a trace element that occurs naturally in the diet . Organic arsenic is generally non-toxic, while inorganic forms can have toxic effects . Food sources of arsenic include seafood, poultry, grains (especially rice), bread, cereal products, mushrooms, and dairy products . The estimated adul</data>
