      <data key="d4">Avens is a perennial shrub growing to 15-70 cm in height. It is native to central and southern Europe, as well as central Asia. It also grows in North America . KEY HIGHLIGHTS - Traditionally used for patients with gastrointestinal conditions, including diarrhea, flatulence, and dyspepsia, but there</data>
