      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Avocado</data>
      <data key="d4">The avocado tree produces fruits called avocados that are edible and have a creamy, smooth texture. The fruit is covered by a thick and bumpy skin, dark green or purplish black in color . Orally, avocado has traditionally been used for its purported antidiarrheal, aphrodisiac, and emmenagogue effect</data>
