      <data key="d4">Ayurveda means "science of life," and it stems from the ancient body of spiritual teachings known as the Vedas. It is an integrated system of specific theories and techniques that use diet, herbs, exercise, meditation, yoga, and massage or bodywork. The goal of Ayurveda is to achieve optimal health</data>
