      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Probiotics</data>
      <data key="d4">The body maintains symbiotic relationships with prokaryotic organisms, some of which are known as "probiotics." In the gastrointestinal tract, these organisms help metabolize food and maintain intestinal health . Probiotics may be taken as supplements or found in foods . A probiotic product must con</data>
      <data key="d5">✅ SAFE: Possibly Safe when Lactobacillus acidophilus, Lacticaseibacillus casei, Lacticaseibacillus paracasei, Lactiplantibacillus plantarum, Ligilactobacillus salivarius, Limosilactobacillus reuteri, Lacticaseibacillus rhamnosus, Bifidobacterium bifidum, and Bifidobacterium longum are used orally and appropriately, short-term. See individual topics for details.</data>
