    <node id="Cannabidiol (Cbd)">
      <data key="d0">supplement</data>
      <data key="d1" />
      <data key="d2">CBD | Nano-cannabidiol</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Cannabidiol-CBD</data>
      <data key="d4">Cannabidiol is a non-psychoactive constituent of Cannabis sativa. Over 80 constituents, known as cannabinoids, have been identified from Cannabis sativa, of which delta-9-tetrahydrocannabinol (THC) is the major psychoactive compound. Cannabidiol makes up around 40% of cannabis extracts . Cannabidiol</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Possibly Unsafe when used orally. The US Food and Drug Administration (FDA) strongly advises against the use of cannabidiol during pregnancy. Cannabidiol products might contain delta-9-tetrahydrocannabinol (THC) or other contaminants such as pesticides, heavy metals, bacteria, and fungus, which can be dangerous to the child . Also, animal research shows that high levels of cannabidiol can damage the reproductive system of male offspring .</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Bergamot">
      <data key="d0">supplement</data>
      <data key="d1">Citrus bergamia</data>
      <data key="d2">Aceite de Bergamota | Bergamot Orange | Bergamota | Bergamote | Bergamotier | Bergamoto | Bergamotte | Bergamotto Bigarade Orange | Huile de Bergamote | KoksalGarry</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Bergamot</data>
      <data key="d4">Bergamot is a citrus fruit that is native to Italy . The peel of the fruit contains the essential oils and other bioactive constituents. The juice is used for nutrition and to make bergamot extract . CHILDREN: Likely Safe when bergamot essential oil is used orally in amounts commonly found in foods.</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Possibly Unsafe when the oil is used topically . There is insufficient reliable information available about the safety of bergamot when taken by mouth in medicinal amounts; avoid use.</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
