      <data key="d4">The Best Life Diet is a 3-phase diet and exercise plan developed by exercise physiologist and certified personal trainer Bob Greene. The diet was popularized after the publication of a book by the same name in 2006. The Best Life Diet focuses on implementing gradual lifestyle changes to encourage lo</data>
      <data key="d5">✅ SAFE: Insufficient reliable information available; however, there is no reason to expect safety issues as long as nutritional needs are met.</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
