      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Beta-Sitosterol</data>
      <data key="d4">Beta-sitosterol is a type of plant sterol. Plant sterols are substances similar to cholesterol found naturally in fruits, cereals, legumes, vegetable oil, nuts, and seeds . In the US, foods containing at least 650 mg of plant sterols are allowed to state that "diets low in saturated fat and choleste</data>
