      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Betel-Nut</data>
      <data key="d4">The betel nut is a type of fruit. It is commonly used for chewing, and is sometimes combined with tobacco or other ingredients to form betel quid or gutka . Some products also contain arecoline hydrobromide, a synthetic form of arecoline, the major alkaloid present in betel nut.</data>
