      <data key="d4">Biofeedback is a technique intended to help an individual become aware and gain control of autonomic physiological body processes. Biofeedback conveys information about blood pressure, heart rate, skin temperature, galvanic skin response (sweating), and muscle tension. An individual participating in</data>
