      <data key="d4">Bioresonance is a healing technique believed to treat illness by normalizing electromagnectic waves emitted from the body. A device called the Mora device is used and believed to receive and assess electromagnetic waves. The device identifies abnormal waves, which are associated with disease, and th</data>
