      <data key="d4">Bog Labrador tea refers to the beverage made from the leaves of the flowering shrub Rhododendron groenlandicum. In some geographical regions, "Labrador tea" refers to beverages made with Rhododendron tomentosum or Rhododendron neoglandulosum, which are more toxic than Rhododendron groenlandicum. Bog</data>
