      <data key="d2">Buckbean | Herbe à Canards | Marsh Trefoil | Ményanthe | Ményanthe à Trois Feuilles | Ményanthe Trèfle d'Eau | Ményanthe Trifolié | Menyanthes | Trèfle d'Eau | Trèfle d'Eau Commun</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Bogbean</data>
      <data key="d4">Bogbean is commonly found in swamps or bogs and produces a fruit that resembles a small bean. The leaves are traditionally used in medicine .</data>
