    <node id="Bois De Rose Oil">
      <data key="d0">supplement</data>
      <data key="d1">Aniba rosaeodora</data>
      <data key="d2">Aceite de Bois de Rosa | Aceite de Palo de Rosa | Cayenne Rosewood Oil | Distilled Oil from Aniba Rosaeodora Wood | Essence de Bois de Rose | Huile de Bois de Rose | Huile de bois de rose | Rosewood Oil</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Bois-de-Rose-Oil</data>
      <data key="d4">Bois de rose oil is the essential oil of the rosewood tree. The tree grows to 30 meters in height and is native to the Amazon region of South America. It is widely used in perfumes and has been used traditionally to treat stress, seizures, and sore muscles .</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Insufficient reliable information available; avoid using.</data>
