    <node id="Boneset">
      <data key="d0">supplement</data>
      <data key="d1">Eupatorium perfoliatum</data>
      <data key="d2">Agueweed | Bois Perfolié | Crosswort | Eupatoire | Eupatoire Perfoliée | Eupatorio | Feverwort | Herbe à Fièvre | Herbe à Souder | Indian Sage</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Boneset</data>
      <data key="d4">Boneset is a plant that is native to eastern North America. It has been traditionally used in Native American medicine . KEY HIGHLIGHTS - Historically used for common cold, influenza, and respiratory tract infection symptoms, but there is insufficient reliable information to rate its effectiveness f</data>
      <data key="d5">ℹ️ No pregnancy data available. Consult your physician.</data>
