      <data key="d2">Antitumor Angiogenesis Factor (anti-TAF) | Bovine Tracheal Cartilage (BTC) | Cartilage bovin | Cartilage Trachéal de Bovins | Cartílago Bovino | Cartílago bovino | Catrix | Catrix-S | Collagen Bovine | Collagène Bovin</data>
