      <data key="d1" />
      <data key="d2">Bovine Immunoglobulin | Bovine Lacteal Compounds | Calostro | Calostro bovino | Colostrum Bovin | Colostrum Bovin Hyperimmune | Colostrum Bovinum | Colostrum de Chèvre | Colostrum de Lait de Vache | Cow Milk Colostrum</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Bovine-Colostrum</data>
      <data key="d4">Bovine colostrum is the milk secreted by cows during the first few days after calving . It provides immunoglobulins, growth factors, cytokines, protein, and other nutrients to the offspring . Hyperimmune bovine colostrum is produced by cows immunized against specific pathogens. CHILDREN: Possibly Sa</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Insufficient reliable information available; avoid using.</data>
