      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Bowen-Technique</data>
      <data key="d4">The Bowen technique originated from Tom Bowen (1916-1982), a self-proclaimed osteopath. This manipulative therapy is used in humans and in animals .</data>
