      <data key="d4">Breadfruit is a tree that is grown in Southeast Asia, the Pacific islands, South India, and some Caribbean islands . Both the fruit and seeds of the breadfruit tree are eaten . The breadfruit tree also provides construction materials, glue, fabric, and insect repellent .</data>
