      <data key="d4">The Bredesen protocol is a therapeutic program of specific dietary and lifestyle changes designed by Dale Bredesen, a physician and researcher specializing in neurodegenerative diseases. The protocol is intended to optimize metabolic parameters in Alzheimer disease and reverse or stop its advancemen</data>
