      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Brewers-Yeast</data>
      <data key="d4">Brewer's yeast is a group of specific strains of Saccharomyces cerevisiae yeast. It is used for brewing ales and as an ingredient in some dietary and nutritional supplements . Brewer's yeast is used as a dietary source of chromium, B-complex vitamins, and selenium. Some dietary supplements containin</data>
