      <data key="d4">Calabar bean is a plant. Despite risks of severe toxicity, the dried seed has been traditionally used as medicine . Calabar bean is a source of the prescription drug physostigmine. Taking calabar bean by mouth can cause severe cholinergic crisis, including paralysis, coma, and death . Unsafe when us</data>
