      <data key="d4">Calamint is a perennial, bushy, aromatic herb that grows in rocky areas and dry meadows, particularly in northern Mediterranean countries, but also in central Europe. In these regions, it has long been used in traditional medicine and as a flavoring agent in cooking .</data>
