      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Calcium-D-Glucarate</data>
      <data key="d4">Calcium D-glucarate is the calcium salt of D-glucaric acid. D-glucaric acid is found in fruits and vegetables and is also produced naturally in the body from D-glucuronic acid metabolism .</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: There is insufficient reliable information available about the safety of calcium D-glucarate during pregnancy and lactation; avoid using.</data>
