      <data key="d4">Canola oil is a type of oil used in food. It is produced from the canola plant, which is an edible variety of rapeseed. Unlike rapeseed oil, which contains the toxin erucic acid at levels of 30% to 50% of fatty acids, canola oil contains erucic acid at levels of less than 2% . Oleic acid is one of t</data>
