      <data key="d4">Cardarine is a metabolic modulator, or a substance that alters how the body metabolizes fat. It is listed on the World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA) prohibited list . NOTE : This is a Fast Facts monograph, intended to give subscribers quick information on newly emerging ingredients in products claiming</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Possibly Unsafe when used orally or parenterally. Some metabolic modulators have been found to cause cancer in animals. Their safety in humans has not been tested . Avoid using.</data>
