      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Cassie-Absolute</data>
      <data key="d4">Cassie absolute is an extract of Acacia farnesiana flowers . It is used as medicine, as a flavoring agent in foods and beverages, and as an insecticide. The plant is grown in tropical areas around the world .</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Insufficient reliable information available; avoid using.</data>
