      <data key="d1" />
      <data key="d2">Canadian Beaver | Castérium | Castor Canadien | Castor Européen | Castor Sibérien | Castóreo | Castoréum | European Beaver | Rognon de Castor | Siberian Beaver</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Castoreum</data>
      <data key="d4">Castoreum is a strong-smelling secretion collected from the scent glands of Canadian, European, and Siberian beavers . It has a long history of use in perfumes. Today, the use of castoreum as a dietary supplement appears to be rare .</data>
      <data key="d5">ℹ️ No pregnancy data available. Consult your physician.</data>
