      <data key="d4">Ceylon cinnamon is the bark of a tropical evergreen tree which grows in Sri Lanka, southern India, and Madagascar. Sri Lanka provides more than 80% of the world's supply of this type of cinnamon . Ceylon cinnamon is one of many types of cinnamon that is commonly sold and marketed as 'cinnamon'; howe</data>
