      <data key="d4">Chenopodium oil is the essential oil of an herb commonly known as epazote, which grows in Central and South America . The oil is high in a constituent called ascaridole . When taken orally, chenopodium oil has been associated with severe organ damage, paralysis, and death. Unsafe when used orally du</data>
