      <data key="d4">Chlorophyll is a group of related green pigment proteins found in photosynthetic organisms. It is related to protoheme, the red pigment of blood . Chlorophyll is found in green leafy vegetables, wheatgrass, green tea, potatoes, and some algae and herbs . Commercial sources of chlorophyll include alf</data>
