      <data key="d4">Chokeberry is the fruit of the aronia shrub. It is commonly consumed in Eastern Europe and Russia . Chokeberry is used to produce fruit syrup, fruit juice, tea, spreads, jellies, and alcoholic drinks, such as spirits and wines. Black chokeberry is the type most commonly used for fruit production . C</data>
