      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Cobalt</data>
      <data key="d4">Cobalt is a metal element. It is magnetic, ductile, and silvery gray in appearance . Cobalt is also the metal component of vitamin B12 (cyanocobalamin) . Cobalt is commonly used as an alloy in steel products, including prosthetic orthopedic joints and other medical devices. It is also found in ceram</data>
