    <node id="Coconut Water">
      <data key="d0">supplement</data>
      <data key="d1">Cocos nucifera</data>
      <data key="d2">Agua de Coco | Asian Coconut Water | Coconut Drink | Coconut Fruit Water | Coconut H2O | Coconut Juice | Coconut Palm Water | Coconut Rehydration Solution | Eau de Coco | Eau de coco</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Coconut-Water</data>
      <data key="d4">Coconut water is the fluid found in coconuts. In contrast, coconut milk is produced from an emulsion of the grated meat and fluid of a coconut . Coconut water contains carbohydrate and is rich in potassium . Coconut water also contains flavonoids, anthocyanins, benzaldehydes, phenolic acids, and ami</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Insufficient reliable information available; avoid using. In one case report, a neonate developed severe hyponatremia (113 mEq/L) with seizures shortly after delivery, which was attributed to the mother's consumption of 3 liters of coconut water at the onset of labor .</data>
      <data key="d6" />
