      <data key="d4">Codonopsis is a family of perennial plant species native to East Asia, especially parts of Korea, Japan, and China. It has been traditionally used in China and Korea to replenish qi (vital energy) deficiency, as an immune tonic, and as a food . Although it is sometimes used as a cheaper alternative</data>
