      <data key="d4">Combretum micranthum is a type of shrub. It is used as a beverage or as medicine in parts of Western Africa . Combretum micranthum is traditionally used for disorders of the gastrointestinal tract, kidney, or liver, as well as for headache, malaria, cough, wounds, diabetes, and as a diuretic.</data>
