      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Cordyceps</data>
      <data key="d4">Cordyceps is a fungus parasite that lives on caterpillars in high mountain regions of China . However, the supply of wild cordyceps is limited . Therefore, commercial products are derived from artificially propagated and fermented cordyceps mycelial cells . Although cordyceps is sometimes referred t</data>
