      <data key="d4">Coriander is an annual herb in the Apiaceae family. Both the fruit (seed) and leaves of the coriander plant are used in foods and as medicine . However, the term "coriander" is typically used to refer to formulations prepared from the fruit of the plant, while cilantro is used to refer to the leaves</data>
