      <data key="d4">Corkwood tree is native to the eastern coastal region of Australia. Duboisia species, including corkwood tree, are cultivated in Australia as a source of scopolamine and atropine. Traditionally, corkwood tree has been used for increasing muscle strength and endurance . Chewing cured and rolled corkw</data>
