      <data key="d4">Corn poppy is an annual plant with bright red flowers. The leaves and flowers have been used in food and beverages in Turkey and other Mediterranean countries . It is native to Europe, North Africa, Western Asia, and Pakistan, and has been introduced to Australia, New Zealand, and North America. It</data>
