      <data key="d4">Curanderismo is a system of medicine that originated in Latin America. It is based on the theory that illnesses have both natural and supernatural sources. Alleged supernatural sources may include evil spirits and brujos (witches). The word curanderismo is derived from the Spanish verb curar, which</data>
