      <data key="d4">Delta-8-tetrahydrocannabinol (delta-8-THC) is a psychoactive cannabinoid found in the Cannabis sativa plant. It is an isomer of delta-9-THC, the major psychoactive component of cannabis . The natural concentration of delta-8-THC in cannabis and hemp is low. Therefore, most delta-8-THC is synthetical</data>
