      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Likely Safe when used orally in amounts commonly found in foods. The typical diet supplies 2-24 mg of diindolylmethane daily . There is insufficient reliable information available about the safety of diindolylmethane when used in amounts greater than those found in foods during pregnancy and lactation; avoid using.</data>
