      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Douglas-fir</data>
      <data key="d4">Douglas fir is a tree that grows up to 60 meters in height. It is native to western North America, particularly the Pacific Coast. Douglas fir essential oil is an oleoresin collected from the trunk of the Douglas fir tree . This essential oil has traditionally been applied topically for wound healin</data>
