      <data key="d4">Durabolin is an anabolic androgenic steroid. An anabolic steroid is chemically and pharmacologically related to testosterone. By definition, it is a schedule III controlled substance and it is not an estrogen, progestin, corticosteroid, or dehydroepiandrosterone. This definition of an anabolic stero</data>
