      <data key="d4">Durian is an evergreen tree found in Malaysia, Singapore, and many other parts of southeast Asia. It grows to a height of 30-40 meters. Durian has a distinctive fruit with a spiky outer covering and a smell of rotten eggs, due to volatile sulfur compounds. In Asia, durian fruit is used as a food and</data>
