      <data key="d4">Dwarf elder is a perennial plant that is native to parts of southern and central Europe, northwest Africa, and southwest Asia. The dwarf elder fruit has a history of use in folk medicine for immune system stimulation and improving inflammatory gastrointestinal conditions . The stems of dwarf elder g</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Likely Unsafe when used orally in large quantities .</data>
