      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Dyers-Broom</data>
      <data key="d4">Dyer's broom is a plant with yellow flowers. It is indigenous to the Mediterranean region and western Asia . Traditionally, dyer's broom has been used for digestive disorders, gout, bladder stones, lower back and pelvic pain, and blood vessel health .</data>
