      <data key="d4">Ear candling, also called thermo-auricular therapy or "coning," is a home remedy used for outer-ear hygiene and the elimination of earwax. Earwax, or cerumen, is the soft, brownish yellow, waxy secretion of the ceruminous glands of the external auditory canal. It is a naturally occurring substance t</data>
