      <data key="d4">Feng shui, meaning "wind and water," is an ancient Chinese philosophy focused on the relationship between people and their environment. It aims to maximize the beneficial movement of energy (qi) through a space . Feng shui originated during the Zhou Dynasty, which lasted from 11th Century B.C.E. to</data>
