      <data key="d4">Fennel is a perennial, aromatic herb with yellow flowers. It is native to the southern Mediterranean region; however, it now grows wild in Asia, North America, and Europe . CHILDREN: Possibly Safe when combination products containing fennel are used to treat colic in infants for up to one week. Stud</data>
