      <data key="d4">Guaiac is a tree. The wood and sap (resin) are used in foods and in edible oils and fats. They have also been used to prepare medicinal extracts. In lab tests for occult blood, guaiac resin is used as a diagnostic reagent . Guaiac wood and resin have traditionally been used for their purported anti-</data>
