      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/HCG-Diet</data>
      <data key="d4">The HCG diet involves a very low-calorie diet and administration of human chorionic gonadotropin (HCG) and is intended to induce weight loss and redistribute fat. HCG is a hormone produced during pregnancy. HCG is approved by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) for use in underdeveloped test</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Likely Unsafe when used by injection. HCG, which is a component of the HCG diet, is teratogenic. It has been linked to a high rate of congenital abnormalities in animal models . Do not use HCG or follow the HCG diet while pregnant.</data>
