      <data key="d4">Hesperidin is a flavanone diglycoside. It is principally found in unripe citrus fruit and is known as a citrus bioflavonoid. Hesperidin is found in both the orange fruit and orange juice . This topic does not discuss proprietary products containing 'Micronized Purified Flavonoid Fraction' (MPFF). Th</data>
