      <data key="d4">Hordenine is a naturally occurring alkaloid structurally similar to tyramine, N-methyltyramine, and synephrine . It is also structurally related to epinephrine and ephedrine . It was first isolated from the cactus species Ariocarpus fissuratus in 1894 and later isolated from germinating barley in 19</data>
