      <data key="d4">Horny goat weed has been used for over 2000 years to treat impotence and infertility . The name is used for several species of the Epimedium genus, although Epimedium grandiflorum and Epimedium sagittatum are most commonly found in supplement products . Epimedium species grow in Asia, Europe, the Mi</data>
