      <data key="d4">Ipecac is a small, perennial shrub that is native to regions of Brazil, as well as to areas of Central America, including Nicaragua, Costa Rica, and Panama . The dried root is used to make a syrup that is used in medicine . Although ipecac is possibly safe when small amounts are used, misuse can lea</data>
