      <data key="d4">The Jenny Craig diet is a diet plan that combines elements of social support, pre-packaged meals, food and nutrition counseling, and exercise in an effort to assist clients in losing weight. It was designed by registered dieticians in consultation with a multidisciplinary medical advisory board. Tho</data>
