      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Juice-Fasting</data>
      <data key="d4">Juice fasting is a type of diet including only juices made from fresh fruits and vegetables. It has been popularized by many sources, including naturopathic physicians, practitioners of Ayurveda, and various books, including the 2007 book, The Juice Fasting Bible .</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Possibly Unsafe during pregnancy and lactation. Juice fasting is not intended to provide adequate nutrition and can result in electrolyte imbalances when used short-term, as well as malnutrition when used long-term .</data>
