      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Juniper</data>
      <data key="d4">Juniper is an evergreen tree found in India, southwest Asia, Europe, and North America . The berries, aerial parts, and bark are all used for various medicinal purposes . There are many varieties of juniper, but Juniperus communis is the most common in North America .</data>
