      <data key="d4">Kampo is a Japanese thought and medicine system for illness and health. The kan (han) character means "from China," and po (ho) means "way." Although kampo shares some aspects with Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM), it is a separate system that utilizes herbal combinations, forms of acupuncture, an</data>
