      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Ketogenic-diet</data>
      <data key="d4">The ketogenic diet requires a high intake of fat and very low intake of carbohydrates, which causes fat to be broken down into ketone bodies for energy. The classic ketogenic diet, which has been used since the 1920s to reduce seizures in children, involves obtaining total energy in a 4:1 ratio of f</data>
