      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Krebiozen</data>
      <data key="d4">Krebiozen was the commercial name for a compound that was claimed to be an effective treatment for cancer. The compound was purportedly prepared from horses that had been inoculated with the bacteria Actinomyces bovis . The compound was brought to the US by Dr. Stevan Durovic in 1949 . The claims th</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Insufficient reliable information is available; avoid using.</data>
