      <data key="d4">Low purine diets involve reducing the intake of foods that are high in purines and increasing the intake of foods that reduce serum uric acid levels . The diet is based on the premise that high levels of uric acid in the blood and joints are due to intake of dietary purines. Purines, including nucle</data>
