      <data key="d4">Macadamia nuts are a type of seed native to Australia. More than 85% of the energy in the macadamia nut is from monounsaturated fat. The nuts are grown commercially in Hawaii and to a much smaller extent in California and Florida . They are commonly consumed as a food. The Food Allergen Labeling and</data>
