      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Marshmallow</data>
      <data key="d4">Marshmallow is a perennial herb that is native to Europe and parts of Asia and cultivated throughout the world . It has been used in traditional European medicine for more than 2000 years. The Emperor Charlemagne ordered marshmallow cultivation in monasteries . Both the marshmallow leaf (unpeeled or</data>
      <data key="d5">⚕️ CONSULT PHYSICIAN: Insufficient reliable information available.</data>
