      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Meadowsweet</data>
      <data key="d4">Meadowsweet is a plant found mainly in damp meadows in Europe and Asia. All parts of the meadowsweet plant (flowers, leaves, and roots) have been used as medicine . Meadowsweet has been traditionally used for its antacid, antibacterial, antirheumatic, anti-gout, anti-inflammatory, antiseptic, antiul</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Likely Unsafe when used orally. Some evidence suggests meadowsweet might stimulate uterine activity .</data>
