    <node id="Mediterranean Diet">
      <data key="d0">supplement</data>
      <data key="d1" />
      <data key="d2">Diet Mediterranean | Dieta mediterránea | Green-Mediterranean Diet | MeDi | Mediterranean Eating Pattern | Mediterranean-Style | Mediterranean-Style Diet | Régime méditerranéen</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Mediterranean-Diet</data>
      <data key="d4">The Mediterranean diet is a plant-based diet that emphasizes the intake of foods such as olive oil, fish, and moderate amounts of red wine. The diet first piqued the public's interest over 60 years ago, when data from the Seven Countries Study found that the diet may have benefit for preventing card</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Possibly Safe when the Mediterranean diet is used appropriately during pregnancy . However, the red wine component of the Mediterranean diet should be avoided in pregnancy.</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
