      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Mesoglycan</data>
      <data key="d4">Mesoglycan is a naturally-occurring glycosaminoglycan that is typically extracted from bovine lung and aortic tissue and porcine intestinal mucosa. It contains heparan sulfate, dermatan sulfate, chondroitin sulfate, and hyaluronic acid .</data>
      <data key="d5">ℹ️ No pregnancy data available. Consult your physician.</data>
