      <data key="d4">Methoxydienone meets the definition of an anabolic androgenic steroid, as determined by the United States Designer Anabolic Steroid Control Act (DASCA) . It is unlawful for anabolic steroids to be added to dietary supplements. Anabolic steroids are also prohibited by the World Anti-Doping Agency (WA</data>
