      <data key="d2">5-Methyl-7-Methoxy Isoflavone | Bioflavonoid | Bioflavonoid Complex | Bioflavonoid Concentrate | Bioflavonoid Extract | Bioflavonoïde | Citrus Bioflavones | Citrus Bioflavonoid | Citrus Bioflavonoid Extract | Citrus Bioflavonoids</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Methoxylated-Flavones</data>
      <data key="d4">Methoxylated flavones are flavonoids with methoxy groups attached . Flavonoids are plant pigments found in all vascular plants. Over 4000 unique flavonoids have been identified . They are responsible for many of the yellow, red, and orange colors in plants. They are also polyphenolic antioxidants .</data>
