      <data key="d4">Methylsynephrine is a synthetic compound. Although it is sometimes found as an ingredient in dietary supplements, it is not approved for use in medications or dietary supplements in the U.S. . Some products claim that methylsynephrine is a natural constituent of bitter orange or Acacia rigidula; how</data>
