    <node id="Mindfulness">
      <data key="d0">supplement</data>
      <data key="d1" />
      <data key="d2">Adapted Mindfulness-Based Intervention | Cognitive-Behavioral and Mindfulness-Based Stress Reduction | Consciencia | Consciencia (atención plena) | MBCR | MBCT | MBRP | MBSR | Mind-Body Bridging | Mindfulness and Acceptance-Based Group Therapy</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Mindfulness</data>
      <data key="d4">Mindfulness is a practice derived from Buddhist theory that involves a purposeful attention and awareness of present thoughts, emotions, and sensations without evaluation or judgement of what is occurring. Various mind-body techniques are used to develop this awareness .</data>
      <data key="d5">⚕️ CONSULT PHYSICIAN: Insufficient reliable information available; however, mindfulness practices have been used in pregnant adults in one study without reports of adverse effects and there is no known reason to expect any adverse effects .</data>
