      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Moneywort</data>
      <data key="d4">Moneywort is a perennial plant that is indigenous to Europe. It has been introduced into America and Japan. The whole flowering plant is used in medicine . KEY HIGHLIGHTS - Traditionally used for diarrhea, atopic dermatitis (eczema), as an expectorant, and for other conditions, but there is no stron</data>
      <data key="d5">ℹ️ No pregnancy data available. Consult your physician.</data>
      <data key="d6" />
