      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Monterey-Pine</data>
      <data key="d4">Monterey pine is a tree native to coastal California and Mexico that is now grown throughout the world. It is commonly cultivated for timber . Monterey pine has traditionally been used as a medicine for various conditions.</data>
