      <data key="d4">Myofascial release involves a gentle form of stretching and compression. The therapy, also known as soft tissue mobilization or MFR, aims to release the uneven tightness in injured fascia. Fascia is the dense, tough tissue that surrounds and covers the body's organs, muscles and bones. In the normal</data>
