      <data key="d4">Myrcia is a genus of medium-sized shrubs (2.5 to 3.5 meters in height). Myrcia species are most common in central and southeastern Brazil. Some species grow in other parts of South America, such as Bolivia, Peru, and Paraguay .</data>
