      <data key="d4">N,N-DMPEA is a chemically modified form of phenethylamine, a monoamine alkaloid found in plants, animals, and certain foods . Phenethylamines such as N,N-DMPEA can also be found in various dietary supplements marketed for weight loss and athletic performance . N,N-DMPEA is also a common food additiv</data>
