      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Nasal-Irrigation</data>
      <data key="d4">Nasal irrigation has been used traditionally to help facilitate drainage from the nose and sinuses . The process involves flushing out the nasal cavity with saline by instilling it in one nostril and allowing it to drain out of the other. Some people use a small neti pot, which looks like a teapot.</data>
