      <data key="d4">Naturopathy is a distinct system of primary health care that uses its own methods to diagnose, treat, and prevent illness. The goal of naturopathic medicine is to restore and maintain optimum health by emphasizing nature's inherent self-healing process through a focus on holistic approaches and prev</data>
