      <data key="d4">The neem tree is thought to have originated in northeast India and Myanmar . The bark, leaves, and seed of the neem tree are sometimes used medicinally . Neem seed oil is approved by the Environmental Protection Agency for pesticide use in the US . Neem twigs, which are used as chewing sticks in lie</data>
