      <data key="d4">The New Zealand green-lipped mussel is a type of mollusk with a green shell . It is native to the New Zealand coast. The mussel is consumed locally as food. It is also used as a dietary supplement . CHILDREN: Possibly Safe when used orally in children 6-14 years of age. New Zealand green-lipped muss</data>
