      <data key="d4">Niauli oil consists of the essential oil distilled from leaves of Melaleuca viridiflora. Avoid confusion with tea tree oil (Maleleuca alternifolia) and cajeput oil (Melaleuca leucodendra and Melaleuca quinquenervia).</data>
      <data key="d5">ℹ️ No pregnancy data available. Consult your physician.</data>
