      <data key="d4">Oats are a type of cereal grain that has been cultivated since the Bronze Age . When consumed as part of the diet they are a good source of protein, fat, and fiber . The FDA allows food products containing oats, with at least 750 mg of soluble fiber per serving, to include a health claim stating tha</data>
