      <data key="d4">Octacosanol is a 28-carbon alcohol that can be extracted from a variety of plant sources, including sugar cane and wheat germ oil . Octacosanol comprises approximately 67% of policosanol, a mixture of long-chain alcohols . Although some research has been conducted using policosanol, little research</data>
