      <data key="d4">Ornithine ketoglutarate is a salt made synthetically from the amino acid ornithine and alpha-ketoglutaric acid, which is a precursor of the amino acid glutamine . CHILDREN: Possibly Safe when used intravenously and appropriately. Ornithine ketoglutarate 15 grams daily, added to total parenteral nutr</data>
