      <data key="d4">Palmitoylethanolamide (PEA) is a fatty acid amide. In the diet it is found in egg yolk and plant fats, such as soy lecithin and ground peanuts . PEA is also made naturally by the body in response to stress and pain. In Europe, PEA is available for use under medical supervision as a micronized or ult</data>
