      <data key="d2">Enzyme Therapy | Fungal Pancreatin | Pancreatic Enzyme Formulation | Pancreatic Enzyme Replacement Therapy (PERT) | Pancreatic Enzymes | Pancreatin | Pancreatina | Pancréatine | Pancréatine Fongique | Pancreatinum</data>
