      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Papaya</data>
      <data key="d4">Papaya is a fruit bearing tree grown in tropical regions including Hawaii, Latin America, the West Indies, India, Indonesia, South Africa, Thailand, and the Philippines. Traditionally, it is used for gastrointestinal complaints and other medicinal uses .</data>
      <data key="d5">✅ SAFE: Likely Safe when the ripe fruit is consumed in amounts commonly found in foods.</data>
      <data key="d6" />
