      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Pareira</data>
      <data key="d4">Pareira is a plant that is native to various regions in South America. The bark and dried roots, as well as the curare (the extract from the fresh or dried trunk), have been traditionally used as medicine. Pareira has been used for its purported diuretic and emmenagogic effects. Pareira contains tub</data>
