      <data key="d4">Patchouli oil is the naturally occurring oil of patchouli (Pogostemon cablin), a bushy herb . Some products labeled as patchouli oil might be adulterated with other oils, including gurjun balsam oil, copaiba balsam oil, and cedarwood oil .</data>
