      <data key="d4">The Patricia Kane protocol, often called the PK protocol, is a three-part program marketed for the treatment of neurologic disorders, such as amyotrophic lateral sclerosis (ALS), Parkinson disease, Alzheimer disease, multiple sclerosis, autism, chronic fatigue syndrome (CFS), and fibromyalgia. The p</data>
      <data key="d5">ℹ️ No pregnancy data available. Consult your physician.</data>
