      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Peanut-Oil</data>
      <data key="d4">Peanut oil is derived from the peanut, which contains up to 50% oil. The peanut plant, a legume, originally comes from South America . Peanut oil is commonly used in cooking, and has also been used as a massage oil and for various skin conditions. The Food Allergen Labeling and Consumer Protection A</data>
