      <data key="d4">Pelargonium sidoides is a perennial flowering plant that is native to South Africa. It is used medicinally among native populations of South Africa . CHILDREN: Possibly Safe when used orally and appropriately, short-term. A specific extract of Pelargonium sidoides (EPs 7630, Dr. Willmar Schwabe Phar</data>
