      <data key="d4">Myroxylon balsamum is a large tree, growing up to 25 meters in height . It is native to Central America, Peru, Venezuela, Sri Lanka, and Jamaica . Peru balsam is exuded from the tree trunk when the bark is removed and the trunk scorched. It is collected by wrapping rags around the trunk, which are t</data>
