      <data key="d4">Piracetam is a synthetic chemical in the family of nootropic chemicals known as racetams . Piracetam was synthesized as a derivative of gamma-aminobutyric acid (GABA) in the 1960s . It is available by prescription in Europe. However, it is not approved as either a drug or dietary supplement in the U</data>
