      <data key="d4">Plant sterols are substances similar to cholesterol found naturally in fruits, cereals, legumes, vegetable oil, nuts, and seeds. There are many plant sterols; however, the main ones are beta-sitosterol, campesterol, and stigmasterol. Foods, including spreads, enriched with plant sterols may contain</data>
