      <data key="d4">Psilocybin is an indolealkylamine that acts as a psychedelic or hallucinogenic compound . Psilocybin is found in mushrooms that are sometimes referred to as "magic mushrooms," usually in the genus Psilocybe . It can also be manufactured synthetically. Traditionally, mushrooms containing psilocybin h</data>
