      <data key="d4">Reflexology is a type of massage therapy that originated from ancient Chinese medical practice. It uses the hand, thumb, and forefinger to apply pressure to the hands, feet, or ears at specific reflex points that are associated with glands or organs. Pressure at these contact points is thought to ch</data>
