      <data key="d4">Reiki therapy is a type of energy medicine that involves the practitioner channeling "universal life energy" to the patient through touch and positive intention of healing. Reiki is a Japanese word that derives from the individual terms "rei", meaning universal energy, and "ki", meaning life energy</data>
      <data key="d5">⚕️ CONSULT PHYSICIAN: Insufficient reliable information available; however, there is no reason to expect adverse effects in lactating or pregnant women.</data>
