      <data key="d2">Brazilian Rhatany | Krameria | Mapato | Peruvian Rhatany | Pumacuchu | Raiz Para Los Dientes | Ratanhia | Ratanhia du Brésil | Ratanhia du Chili | Ratanhia du Pérou</data>
