      <data key="d2">Arabinoxylan rice bran | Arabinoxylane | Arabinoxylane Compound Proprietary Blend | BioBran | Composé arabinoxylane de son de riz | Hemicellulose Complex with Arabinoxylane | MGN-3 | MGN-3 Arabinoxylan | RBAC | Rice Bran Arabinoxylan</data>
