      <data key="d2">Extensive Rice Hydrolysate | Extensively Hydrolyzed Rice Protein | Hydrolyzed Rice Bran Protein | Hydrolyzed Rice Protein | Partial Rice Hydrolysate | Partially Hydrolyzed Rice Protein | Proteína del arroz | Protéine de riz | Rice Bran Protein | Rice Endosperm Protein</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Rice-protein</data>
      <data key="d4">Rice protein is the protein isolated from rice. Rice protein is sometimes used as a protein supplement because it can be mixed in other foods or in beverages . Hydrolyzed rice protein is made by enzymatically hydrolyzing the protein .</data>
