      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Rooibos</data>
      <data key="d4">Rooibos is tea prepared from the leaves and stems of the indigenous South African leguminous shrub Aspalathus linearis. The fragrant, caffeine-free tea is the national drink of South Africa . Rooibos is found in red and green varieties, with red being the fermented, variety with a slightly sweeter t</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Insufficient reliable information available; avoid using.</data>
