      <data key="d4">Rusty-leaved rhododendron is a shrub native to the Pyrenees and European Alps, growing in areas with silica-rich soil . The German Commission E and other authors consider rhododendron species to be poisonous, but more recent evidence suggests this may not apply to rusty-leaved rhododendron . Use cau</data>
