      <data key="d4">S-23 is a selective androgen receptor modulator (SARM). Unlike anabolic steroids, SARMs selectively bind to the androgen receptor. SARMs are not legally allowed to be included in dietary supplements. The U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) warned that supplements containing SARMs have been assoc</data>
