      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Stem-Cell-Therapy-DirecttoConsumer</data>
      <data key="d4">Stem cells are cells with high self-renewal capacity that have the potential to differentiate into specialized cells in the body. Stem cells function to regenerate and replace damaged and diseased tissues in the body. Two main types of stem cells are pluripotent (embryonic) stem cells and tissue-spe</data>
      <data key="d5">ℹ️ No pregnancy data available. Consult your physician.</data>
