      <data key="d2">SR9009 | SR-9009 | Stenabolic - [DATOS BÁSICOS] | Sténabolique - [FAITS EN BREF]</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Stenabolic-FAST-FACTS</data>
      <data key="d4">Stenabolic is a metabolic modulator, or a substance that alters how the body metabolizes fat. It is listed on the World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA) prohibited list . NOTE : This is a Fast Facts monograph, intended to give subscribers quick information on newly emerging ingredients in products claiming</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Possibly Unsafe when used orally or parenterally. Some metabolic modulators have been found to cause cancer in animals. Their safety in humans has not been tested . Avoid using.</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
