      <data key="d4">Streptococcus thermophilus is a lactic acid-producing bacteria. Strains of S. thermophilus are used extensively in the manufacture of fermented dairy products. In supplements, S. thermophilus is often used in combination with other bacteria as a probiotic . Coronavirus disease 2019 (COVID-19): Despi</data>
