      <data key="d4">Sunflower oil is derived from the seeds of the sunflower plant and traditionally contains high amounts of the essential fatty acid, linoleic acid . When the oil is derived from plants bred to contain high amounts of oleic acid, it is referred to as high-oleic acid sunflower oil . Traditionally, sunf</data>
