      <data key="d4">Superoxide dismutase (SOD) is an essential enzyme found in all living cells. It catalyzes the conversion of the oxygen radical superoxide, produced during normal cellular processes, to oxygen and hydrogen peroxide . CHILDREN: Possibly Safe when administered via subcutaneous injection. Superoxide dis</data>
