      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/Sweet-Woodruff</data>
      <data key="d4">Sweet woodruff is a plant native to Europe, Iran, Siberia, and Northern Africa. Its leaves and flowers are used medicinally for a variety of ailments . Traditionally, woodruff is used for digestive and liver problems .</data>
