      <data key="d4">Syrian rue is a plant that is native to the western United States, temperate and tropical areas of Asia, northern and tropical Africa, and southern and eastern Europe . It is traditionally used as an abortifacient, for various menstrual disorders, and for its anxiolytic, analgesic, antiparasitic, an</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Likely Unsafe when used orally. Syrian rue can induce labor . Fetal death has also been reported in patients taking Syrian rue to induce an abortion .</data>
