      <data key="d4">Tai chi is one specific type of Qi gong that was originally developed in China as a martial art for self-defense . Tai chi involves controlled breathing and slow, rhythmic circular body movements thought to facilitate the flow of internal energy or 'qi' . Different styles of tai chi include Chen, Ya</data>
      <data key="d5">⚕️ CONSULT PHYSICIAN: Insufficient reliable information available. Advise patients to consult with their personal healthcare provider before initiating tai chi or any other exercise program during pregnancy or lactation.</data>
