      <data key="d4">Testolone is a selective androgen receptor modulator (SARM), a compound which binds to the androgen receptor in select tissues, avoiding or minimizing sex tissue proliferation or hypertrophy . Although SARMs are not legally allowed to be included in dietary supplements in the US, they are sometimes</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Possibly Unsafe when used orally. The U.S. Food and Drug Administration and other regulatory agencies warn that dietary supplements containing selective androgen receptor modulators (SARMs) are dangerous . Avoid using.</data>
