      <data key="d4">Tetrahydrocannabivarin is a non-psychoactive analogue of tetrahydrocannabinol (THC) that occurs naturally in the Cannabis sativa plant . There is interest in its use for analgesic and anticonvulsant effects, as well as for various neurological and metabolic disorders. Both delta-8- and delta-9-tetra</data>
