      <data key="d4">Therapeutic touch is intended to treat medical conditions by manipulating the "human energy field" with the practitioner's hands just above the skin. It was developed by Dolores Krieger, PhD, RN, and Dora Kunz in the 1970s. Therapeutic touch is primarily practiced by nurses ; however, there is no un</data>
      <data key="d5">✅ SAFE: Possibly Safe when used appropriately. Therapeutic touch has been used with apparent safety in clinical studies in pregnant and lactating patients with no reported adverse effects .</data>
