      <data key="d4">Trigger point therapy involves the stimulation of myofascial trigger points in muscles to relieve pain and dysfunction. Trigger points are hypersensitive points in taut bands of skeletal muscle that are painful with mechanical stimulation, elicit referred pain, and generate motor dysfunction . They</data>
