      <data key="d4">Viburnum opulus is a shrub with varieties native to Europe, northern Africa, northern Asia, and North America. It has been used throughout the world as an ornamental plant and in medicine . Traditionally, Viburnum opulus is used for respiratory and gastrointestinal symptoms, infertility, uterine or</data>
