      <data key="d4">Zero balancing is a type of bodywork that originated in the 1970s from an osteopath, medical doctor, and acupuncturist named Frederick Fritz Smith. Zero balancing is said to be different from other types of bodywork because it is designed to focus on both body structure and energy flow at the same t</data>
