      <data key="d4">The Zone diet, which was popularized by Dr. Barry Sears in his 1995 book, The Zone, is a high-protein, calorie-restrictive diet. It is intended to provide adequate protein and moderate levels of carbohydrates, essential fats, and micronutrients spread throughout three meals and two snacks. Overall,</data>
