      <data key="d4">1,3-DMAA is a synthetic stimulant . It was originally developed as a pharmaceutical ingredient for relieving nasal congestion . More recently, it has been marketed in dietary supplements for athletic performance or weight loss. KEY HIGHLIGHTS - Used for obesity, attention deficit-hyperactivity disor</data>
