      <data key="d2">1 | 3-Dimethylbutanamine | 1 | 3-Dimethyl-Butylamine | 1 | 3-Dimethylbutylamine Citrate | 2-Amino-4-Methylpentane | 2-Amino-4-Methylpentane Citrate | 4-Amino Methylpentane Citrate | 4-Amino-2-Methylpentane Citrate</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/13DMBA</data>
      <data key="d4">1,3-DMBA is a chemical . Some supplements claim that 1,3-DMBA is extracted from pouchong tea or Coreopsis tinctoria. However, the amount of 1,3-DMBA found in products marketed for athletic performance and weight loss is much greater than the quantity that is found in nature. This has raised concerns</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Likely Unsafe when used orally. 1,3-DMBA is thought to have stimulant and vasoconstrictive effects which might increase the risk of serious adverse effects.</data>
