      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/14Butanediol</data>
      <data key="d4">1,4-butanediol is a chemical. It is used as a recreational drug as a source of gamma-hydroxybutyrate (GHB), a compound with both euphoric and sedative effects. However, 1,4-butanediol has led to severe illnesses and death . In Canada, 1,4-butanediol is regulated as a schedule VI controlled substance</data>
      <data key="d5">⚠️ AVOID: Unsafe when used orally .</data>
