      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/14DMAA</data>
      <data key="d4">1,4-DMAA is a chemical . It has been found in very small amounts in geranium plants ; however, the amount of 1,4-DMAA found in products marketed for athletic performance or weight loss is much greater than the quantity that is found in nature. This has raised concerns that manufacturers are spiking</data>
      <data key="d5">ℹ️ No pregnancy data available. Consult your physician.</data>
