      <data key="d2">17-one | 3beta-hydroxy-androst-4-ene-17-one | 4-androstene-3beta-ol | 4-androstene-3beta-ol-17-one | 4-Androsterona | 4-Androstérone | 4-Dehydroepiandrosterone | 4-DHEA</data>
      <data key="d3">https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/Data/ProMonographs/4-Androsterone</data>
      <data key="d4">4-Androsterone is a prohormone that is included as an ingredient in a variety of supplements marketed to athletes and bodybuilders . Prohormones are typically designed to be metabolized to anabolic compounds . Although there is very little known about these compounds, they may cause serious anabolic</data>
      <data key="d5">ℹ️ No pregnancy data available. Consult your physician.</data>
