      <data key="d8">0.9</data>
      <data key="d9">HEART DISEASE: Theoretically, American hellebore might worsen cardiac disease by depressing cardiac activity, causing bradycardia or arrhythmias . Avoid use in patients with cardiovascular disease.</data>
