    <edge source="Chelation Therapy Products" target="Magnesium">
      <data key="d7">INTERACTS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d8">0.9</data>
      <data key="d9">MAGNESIUM: Ethylenediamine tetraacetic acid (EDTA) may reduce magnesium levels. EDTA can bind to and cause increased urinary excretion of magnesium . ---</data>
