    <edge source="Chelation Therapy Products" target="Diabetes">
      <data key="d7">INTERACTS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d8">0.9</data>
      <data key="d9">DIABETES: Chelation therapy with disodium ethylenediamene tetraacetic acid (EDTA) may result in poor control of glucose levels in diabetic patients. Disodium EDTA can interact with insulin preparation</data>
    </edge>
