      <data key="d8">0.9</data>
      <data key="d9">HERBS AND SUPPLEMENTS WITH SEDATIVE PROPERTIES: Theoretically, GBL may increase the risk of respiratory and central nervous system (CNS) depression. GBL is metabolized to gamma-hydroxybutyrate (GHB). </data>
