      <data key="d8">0.9</data>
      <data key="d9">IRON-DEFICIENCY ANEMIA: IP-6 might decrease dietary and supplemental iron absorption. IP-6 chelates multivalent metal ions in the gastrointestinal tract, preventing absorption .</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Ip-6" target="Surgery">
      <data key="d7">INTERACTS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d8">0.9</data>
      <data key="d9">SURGERY: IP-6 has antiplatelet effects. IP-6 might cause excessive bleeding if used perioperatively. Tell patients to discontinue IP-6 at least 2 weeks before elective surgical procedures. None known.</data>
    </edge>
