      <data key="d8">0.9</data>
      <data key="d9">HEMODIALYSIS: DL-carnitine might cause myasthenia-like symptoms when administered by IV after dialysis. L-carnitine has not been reported to have this effect . Avoid use of DL-carnitine in patients on</data>
