      <data key="d9">CYTOCHROME P450 2D6 (CYP2D6) SUBSTRATES: Interaction Rating Moderate Be cautious with this combination. Severity MODERATE Occurrence POSSIBLE Level of Evidence D (In vitro or animal study) 1,3-DMAA st</data>
