    <edge source="1,3-Dmaa" target="Herbs And Supplements With Stimulant Properties">
      <data key="d7">INTERACTS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d8">0.9</data>
      <data key="d9">HERBS AND SUPPLEMENTS WITH STIMULANT PROPERTIES: 1,3-DMAA is thought to have stimulant effects. There is concern that taking 1,3-DMAA with other herbs and supplements with stimulant properties might i</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="1,3-Dmaa" target="Hypertension">
      <data key="d7">INTERACTS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d8">0.9</data>
      <data key="d9">HYPERTENSION: 1,3-DMAA is thought to have stimulant and vasoconstrictive effects. Acute ingestion of specific 1,3-DMAA-containing products (OxyELITE Pro or Jack3d, USPlabs) has been found to increase </data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="1,3-Dmaa" target="Narrow-Angle Glaucoma">
      <data key="d7">INTERACTS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d8">0.9</data>
      <data key="d9">NARROW-ANGLE GLAUCOMA: 1,3-DMAA is thought to have stimulant and vasoconstrictive effects. Theoretically, 1,3-DMAA might exacerbate narrow-angle glaucoma.</data>
    </edge>
