      <data key="d8">0.9</data>
      <data key="d9">BRADYCARDIA: Theoretically, use of 1,4-butanediol might cause additive bradycardia. 1,4-Butanediol is metabolized to gamma-hydroxybutyrate GHB, which can cause bradycardia ; avoid using.</data>
